 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Semisimplification of a Weil representation",
 "statement": "For a composition series\n$V_\\bullet$, the *semisimplification* is\n\n$$\nV^{\\mathrm{ss}}:=\\bigoplus_{i=1}^{t}V_i/V_{i-1}.\n$$\n\nThat its isomorphism class does not depend on the chosen composition\nseries is recorded with the other properties of this construction; the\nmultiset of its simple summands is the composition-factor multiset of\n[lem-mg-jordan-holder].",
